      "body": "## Security Scan Results\n\nWe ran your contracts through our AI-powered security scanner and found potential issues.\n\n### Summary\n\n| Severity | Count |\n|----------|-------|\n| 🔴 Critical | 0 |\n| 🟠 High | 1 |\n| 🟡 Medium | 0 |\n| 🔵 Low | 6 |\n\n### Categories Identified\n\n- Unused Import Of Enum.Sol\n- [Cross-Contract] Inconsistent Event Coverage Between Ownerma\n- Solc-Version\n- Incorrect Natspec Title\n- [Cross-Contract] Multisend Delegatecall From Exectransaction\n- Event Emission Order Inconsistency In Swapowner\n- Unaligned Free Memory Pointer In Exectransactionfrommodulere\n- Refund Calculation Degrades To Zero On Zero-Gasprice Network\n\n### View Your Report\n\n**Free teaser report:** [https://reports.vericodeai.com/c02182e2a915?utm_source=github&utm_medium=issue&utm_campaign=security](https://reports.vericodeai.com/c02182e2a915?utm_source=github&utm_medium=issue&utm_campaign=security)\n\nThe teaser shows vulnerability types found. Full details (file locations, code snippets,\nfix recommendations) available after free signup.\n\n---\n\n### About This Scan\n\n- Scanner trained on **500,000+ findings** from real audits (Code4rena, Sherlock, Immunefi, etc.)\n- This is an automated security notice, not a sales pitch\n- **To opt out:** close this issue and comment \"opt-out\" — we won't contact you again\n\n*Powered by [Vericode AI](https://vericodeai.com) — AI Smart Contract Security*\n",
